/-- **Limb derivation** for `fd_r43x6_mul_fast`: the denotation is the lane
expression `mulFastResult x y`. Lanes 6 and 7 of `x` are ignored by the
program (the `wwl_permute` masks select only lanes 0-5); lanes 6 and 7 of
`y` do occur, and are eliminated at the `Spec` layer by the contract
hypotheses. -/
theorem denote_fd_r43x6_mul_fast (x y : Vector (BitVec 64) 8) :
    fd_r43x6_mul_fast.denote
        (Ctxt.Valuation.ofPair (y.map PoisonOr.value) (x.map PoisonOr.value)) =
